{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06305","headline":"古意二首 一 · 祖咏","name":"古意二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫差日淫放，举国求妃嫔。\n自谓得王宠，代间无美人。\n碧罗象天阁，坐辇乘芳春。\n宫女数千骑，常游江水滨。\n年深玉颜老，时薄花妆新。\n拭泪下金殿，娇多不顾身。\n生前妬歌舞，死後同灰尘。\n冢墓令人哀，哀於铜雀台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"祖咏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06305.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06305","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}